  "title": "Vertiv Achieves Three Industry-leading Awards from Frost & Sullivan",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, has received three industry leadership awards from Frost & Sullivan, with recognition in EMEA for product leadership in the prefabricated modular (PFM) data center industry, and for competitive strategy and customer value leadership in the Asia-Pacific critical power industry.",
